  "description": "Change the use license to A3 use for catering business and the sale of hot food to be cooked on site kitchen. This application consists of an existing retail shop, we would like to now use as a restaurant as shown on the submitted application drawings. The subject property is the ground floor commercial space of the above property address. The existing property is within the parade of shops on High Street South, E6 3PG. Internally, the property is divided into 3 sections divided by load-bearing walls. The proposed drawings show the conversion of these spaces into a restaurant with storage, a kitchen to the rear and WC. Following the government changes to the planning Use Class system, the existing and proposed use both fall within the Use Class (E), for this reason, we are submitting this Lawful Development Certificate Application to get an official confirmation from Planning Officers, the proposed use is lawful in line with planning legislation.\n",
